      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Flowers</h1>\n    <p> These are all the pages that I have made about flowers.  You can go to the pages by clicking on the links under the headers below.</p>\n    <h2> \n      Roses \n    </h2>\n    <p>The rose might be the most famous type of flower, and even Shakespeare wrote about it.  (<a href=\"rose.html\">Learn more.</a>)\n    <h2> \n      Daisies \n    </h2>\n    <p>Daisies aren't as famous as roses, but they are a pretty, everyday flower. If you want to learn more about daisies, I have a page at <a href=\"daisy.html\">daisy.html</a>.</p>\n    <h2> \n      Sunflower\n    </h2>\n    <p>The last flower is the sunflower, which is also the only one on the list that creates yummy seeds to eat.  I hope you like it, too. <a href=\"sunflower.html\">Please click on my link to learn more about sunflowers, because you for sure will not regret it!</a></p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "daisy.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n<body>\n    <a href=\"index.html\">Back to Home</a>\n  <h1>Daisies</h1>\n  <h2> Fun Facts </h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>They are the largest family of plants in the entire world</li>\n    <h6> The family of daisies make up almost 10% of all plants on this earth. That's incredible. </h6>\n    <li>Bees are a huge fan of daisies</li>\n    <h6> They are vital in the honey making process </h6>\n    <li>You can find them on every continent except Antartica</li>\n    <h6> And if not carefully grown and contained, they can actually turn into weeds! </h6>\n    <li>Daisy leaves are put into salads to eat</li>\n    <h6> They are apparently a good source of Vitamin C (I do not like salads though) </h6>\n  </ul>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "rose.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <a href=\"index.html\">Back to Home</a>\n    <h1>Roses</h1>\n    <img src=\"thorns.jpg\" alt=\"thorns\">\n    <h6> Myriam Zilles, Pixabay, Pixabay License </h6>\n    <p> Roses are my least favorite flower because of their thorns. But I guess I can put some fun facts about them up here too. </p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Roses are well known as symbols of love</li>\n      <li>Roses are used in perfumes a lot because of their nice scent</li>\n      <li>It is England's country flower and the state flower of four states in the United States.</li>\n    </ol>\n    \n  </body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "sunflower.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <a href=\"index.html\">Back to Home</a>\n    <h1>\n      Sunflowers\n    </h1>\n    <h3>\n      Why I Love Them\n    </h3>\n    <p>\n      Sunflowers are my personal favorite flowers. My parents used to always grow them in our backyard and they would always grow so high. The tallest sunflower that ever grew I believe was about 30 feet tall! That's taller than any human! But to get that tall they need a lot of sun, at least 6-8 hours of sun a day.  \n    </p>\n    <img src=\"sunflower.jpg\" alt=\"sunflower field\">\n    <h6> Bruno Glastch, Pixabay, Pixabay License </h6>\n  </body>\n</html> ",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
